{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春王二月丁丑，公薨于臺下。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"二、秦伯罃卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"三、夏五月戊戌，齊人弒其君商人。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"四、六月癸酉，葬我君文公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"五、秋，公子遂、叔孫得臣如齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"六、冬十月，子卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"子卒者孰謂？謂子赤也。何以不日？隱之也。何隱爾？弒也。弒則何以不日？不忍言也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"七、夫人姜氏歸于齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"八、季孫行父如齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"九、莒弒其君庶其。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_114_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_114","textTraditional":"稱國以弒何？稱國以弒者，眾弒君之辭。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}